come", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01J9BPzrq2viKryzbdSpNNQg", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 62658, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01J9BPzrq2viKryzbdSpNNQg", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 65359, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UtSPsPYaPnQCY5bX2TT9Wk", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 65659, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UtSPsPYaPnQCY5bX2TT9Wk", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 65659, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UtSPsPYaPnQCY5bX2TT9Wk", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 70337, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's passing health checks again. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Choosing the version:** The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west. The release before it (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy, so I went back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt failed with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions on v2.3.1. I retried once and that finished the rollback. I then confirmed all three regions are on v2.3.0.\n- **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created. I didn't retry, so the on-call engineer was paged only once. The incident describes the failure, the stalled first rollback, the current state, and two follow-ups:\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures before redeploying it.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CSLjk2xcKctzsgo34Av5JL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Dem9g3K1jsVoeMoYyCPfKZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). Seq 2 (v2.3.1-rc) and seq 3 (v2.3.1) are both unhealthy. Next I'll roll back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UXHhivdzDWM8nBcmX3CEWh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Lb4QvsSidv8MhKKVGU3zXq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only got through in us-east. Rolling back to a known-good version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019Dn9KML4dmK21nGmQwnrai", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015MiqAUHf1PmkV1BVDBvXx6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": 